<title>USA: S&amp;P adds Guidant to S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P adds Guidant to S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Equity Services Group of Standard &amp; Poor's said on Wednesday it will add Guidant Corp to the S&amp;P 500 Index, replacing Bally Entertainment Corp after the close of trading on November 22.</p>
<p>Bally Entertainment is being acquired by Hilton Hotels Corp, already a component of the S&amp;P 500 Index.</p>
<p>Guidant manufactures products used in cardiac rhythm management, coronary artery disease treatments and other minimally invasive surgical procedures.</p>
<p>The Indianapolis-based company will be added to the S&amp;P 500 Health Care industry group.</p>
<p>The Equity Services Group of Standard &amp; Poor's is a unit of McGraw-Hill Cos Inc.</p>
</text>
